trump-tariffs/a-78542754?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Canada is facing new US import penalties after Prime Minister Mark Carney refused to match US tariffs on China. Other countries are watching as the Trump trade clash turns into a fight over economic sovereignty.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Inside the sea cucumber smuggling boom</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:324f0d971671a0d4358c4611b540b98a796387acf894ae3a3fe69b7a188a5f53</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T10:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/inside-the-sea-cucumber-smuggling-boom/a-78005662--ad829420fb34.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/inside-the-sea-cucumber-smuggling-boom/a-78005662?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A quiet multimillion‑dollar black market is exploding across the Indian Ocean, driven by one unlikely animal: the sea cucumber.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Ailing Djokovic 'despised' every moment of US Open defeat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ffba8d841f61d58a2b66fa9d2d28f6a91344f8fae5ba4dbf5dcfb33eb9ba77a1</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T09:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ailing-djokovic-despised-every-moment-of-us-open-defeat/a-78572187--352c93994800.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ailing-djokovic-despised-every-moment-of-us-open-defeat/a-78572187?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Novak Djokovic has exited in the first round of a Grand Slam for the first time in over two decades. Could time — or an unknown health condition — be catching up with the Serbian tennis legend?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>EU wants drones to spray pesticides, but it could backfire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7fc9548ff55a8484c2094c617d5311d197e1