ca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Bronze Age collapse may have started with a water crisis. The droughts of today raise the unsettling question of whether it could happen again.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Influential humanists: These are the winners of the Goethe Medal 2026</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1780b337c606ef40a09545195e3074d853388e2c18b53b9be9bc6062467d3ad8</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T12:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/influential-humanists-these-are-the-winners-of-the-goethe-medal-2026/a-78497975--2a003f94b40a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/influential-humanists-these-are-the-winners-of-the-goethe-medal-2026/a-78497975?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The prestigious German cultural award recognizes the artistic work and commitment to cultural dialogue of Arvo Pärt, Anita Raja and Prodromos Tsinikoris.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's military wants to recruit tech-savvy gamers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1868aa9be3c34c82ca316049878b27047ed85659cff03a803998ad1b2f0940af</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T10:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-military-wants-to-recruit-tech-savvy-gamers/a-78536462--a4ab0409cda1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-military-wants-to-recruit-tech-savvy-gamers/a-78536462?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Bundeswehr has been a fixture at Gamescom, Cologne's video game trade fair, for years. But critics say military recruitment does not belong at an entertainment convention.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Tragedy in Nepal: How do flash floods happen?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d345a9719468c1c00e9af17b44089c342194e2d7a295da142ba3b9384f4d5801</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T14:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tragedy-in-nepal-how-do-flash-floods-happen/a-78526421--1b448fe4e3c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tragedy-in-nepal-how-do-flash-floods-happen/a-78526421?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">When flash floods sweep through the Himalayas, there is often little time to react. Scientists are working to understand the risks and improve early warning systems.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>The great lake divide: Collapse vs. comeback</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:afe654dc6891de436848c0f728c515da0fedabccc383668abc6984c5e2097fd9</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T09:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-great-lake-divide-collapse-vs-comeback/a-78460263--04bbfa728d70.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-great-lake-divide-collapse-vs-comeback/a-78460263?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As some of the world's biggest lakes vanish in real time, others are proving that recovery is still within reach.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Why social media addiction is so hard to regulate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:334c75cda323af3af88b2013735a28a4aa2ff0eeccd07d72b8fbd503b3a01010</id><updated>2026-09-25T05:06:51Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T09:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-social-media-addiction-is-so-hard-to-regulate/a-78482023--933d64d6576a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-social-media-addiction-is-so-hard-to-regulate/a-78482023?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Facebook, Instagram and other social media platforms are accused of deliberately fostering addictive behavior among young users. Yet regulators continue to struggle to rein in their engagement-driven business models.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry></feed>
